SELECT 'Under the Bonnet: Going Deeper', 'The follow-on to Digital Foundations, for people who want to understand how software is really made and where it quietly goes wrong. How code runs, the languages and tools teams use, containers and DevOps, the main kinds of database and graphs, YAML and other formats, race conditions and how banks keep money safe, where complexity should live, and how to get the best from AI. Plain English, with animated diagrams and something to try in every lesson. Best read after Digital Foundations.', (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(c.sort_order), 0) + 1 FROM pm_learning_courses c)
FROM DUAL WHERE @exists = 0;
